---
/**
 * Icon — renders an inline SVG icon by name.
 * Icons are referenced by name from the JSON configuration files (e.g. "icon": "puzzle").
 * Stroke icons inherit `currentColor`; brand icons (github, youtube, ...) are filled.
 * To add an icon, add an entry to `icons` below and use its key in any JSON file.
 */
